	(text "f = 1 / (2.5 x 100k x 15n) = 267 Hz; Q14 high after 8192 counts = 31 s, then D505 stops the oscillator (WARM_OK latched until the heater goes or +5 V restarts). Cleared while the heater is absent and by the power-on pulse (C507 / R519)."
