	(text "HV_PERMIT = BIAS_OK AND OC_OK AND WARM_OK AND HV_PERMIT_REQ (high-side switch Q502), and OC_OK alone on the low-side switch Q503: one shorted transistor can't give a permit. Loop: +15 V - Q502 - 1.3k - monitor LED - W16 - the HV supplies' opto LED - W16 - Q503 - GND: 9.4 mA. No current = HV off."
